     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><div>Hi,</div><div><br></div><div>I am testing measurement invarience in Lavaan. Now i have establied strong measurement invariance and want to do latent mean comparison in R (lavaan).</div><div>Please guide me how i can do latent mean comparison between two countries? Which commands will be used?</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks!</div><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "aLDD6eHTBAAJ",
   "from": "kma...@aol.com",
